// What the Mindset feed is made of (client/src/components/family-hub/Mindset.tsx). Quotes are short lines from
// people long gone, verses are the King James Version (public domain), the Bible stories are retold in our own
// words, and the advice, affirmations, prompts, challenges and lessons were written for Arise. Every card has
// topics, so the questionnaire's answers (shared/mindset.ts) decide what each person sees most.

